story arcs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many mysteries to solve...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/c4db48ecf6ad57627d2b125e71a3d7c5.poster.avif?t=1755190570\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/c4db48ecf6ad57627d2b125e71a3d7c5.webm?t=1755190570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/c4db48ecf6ad57627d2b125e71a3d7c5.mp4?t=1755190570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LORE: Uncover the secrets left behind by your creator...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Guidelines, here you can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming yet unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very distinct soundtrack from the rest of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal settings exploring wild themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of questions left to answer...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/7ed29b1140e6a9ffb0151088fb180219.poster.avif?t=1755190570\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/7ed29b1140e6a9ffb0151088fb180219.webm?t=1755190570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/7ed29b1140e6a9ffb0